comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T08:33:01.251Z","harness:codex","GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/926. Duplicate check searched all 2,351 items across every status for stale global pm,pinned/newer CLI and SDK,lockfile mismatch,and GH-926; no canonical issue existed."
  "2026-08-07T08:47:15.053Z","harness:codex","Governance repair: removed the redundant blocks edge to its scalar parent pm-usfg. Parent lineage remains authoritative and avoids increasing the active blocks asymmetry population tracked by pm-jkbqt8."
  "2026-08-08T10:32:48.490Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence 2026-08-08: the public SDK discovers the strongest declared, installed, npm, pnpm, or yarn date-version pin; read/help/dry-run paths remain available; stale writes return project_runtime_stale_mutation exit 4 before bundle dispatch; PM_ALLOW_STALE_CLI=1 is explicit and observable. Linked tests pass, packed npx and bunx consumers pass, and temporary stale mutation acceptance returned exit 4 without touching the real tracker."
  "2026-08-08T12:27:55.099Z","harness:codex","Review correction: Sourcery's PR #935 assessment is valid against the live GitHub issue. GH-926 says context/health and other reads should expose the mismatch. Implementing a stable non-blocking warning now rather than closing the item on mutation safety alone."
  "2026-08-08T12:41:12.094Z","harness:codex","Verification 2026-08-08: focused SDK/CLI suite passes 75 tests, including packaged dist execution in a temporary pinned project. Exact repository coverage passes 453 files and 7,061 tests at 50,228/50,228 statements, 36,690/36,690 branches, 10,319/10,319 functions, and 48,631/48,631 lines. SDK surface, contract snapshot, lint, typecheck, zero-clone, and 100% docstring gates are current."
  "2026-08-08T12:42:51.289Z","harness:codex","Manual temporary-workspace acceptance: initialized an isolated tracker, pinned @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.9, then ran built pm 2026.8.7 context --json. Exit was 0; stdout parsed as the context object; stderr parsed as type=warning, code=project_runtime_stale_read with exact executing/project versions. Temporary evidence directory was removed after verification."
