close_reason: "Implemented the complete GH-926 compatibility contract: typed SDK mismatch inspection, fail-closed stale mutation refusal, non-blocking structured stale-read warnings for context/health/help and other reads, explicit recovery override, generated surfaces, docs, packaged temporary-workspace acceptance, linked tests, and exact 100/100/100/100 repository coverage."
